WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A dinner enquiry starts with a conversation. FormBridge helps your team keep

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.250
every detail clear.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:11.614
Bring in a voice message. Check the transcript before it enters the

00:00:11.614 --> 00:00:12.400
booking desk.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:18.134
When four guests become five, the brief follows. After eight stays a

00:00:18.134 --> 00:00:21.100
preference, until an exact time is agreed.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:27.664
Check the messages behind each detail, including the customer's answer to a

00:00:27.664 --> 00:00:28.650
staff suggestion.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:34.133
Ask the assistant for a follow-up or shift note. Review the suggestion,

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.550
then apply it to your draft.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:42.086
Keep guest preferences alongside the enquiry, so the next shift knows what

00:00:42.086 --> 00:00:42.900
needs attention.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:48.382
Save the enquiry to your private team. See the service ahead, and

00:00:48.382 --> 00:00:51.200
download a handoff for the next shift.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:57.936
FormBridge. Clear details. Thoughtful handoff. Open the booking desk and bring your

00:00:57.936 --> 00:00:58.950
own enquiry.
